OL,3,ABaby wards to get cot cams, says health
OL,4,Asecretary, after inquiry into deaths at
OL,5,ALucy Letby hospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper says the
OL,8,Fgovernment will "urgently develop
OL,9,Fplans" to put live-streaming monitors
OL,10,Fon cots in neonatal wards
OL,12,FThe cameras are among a series of
OL,13,Frecommendations from the Thirlwall
OL,14,FInquiry, which examined the hospital
OL,15,Fwhere killer nurse Lucy Letby worked -
OL,16,Fhere's what else was suggested
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
