OL,3,ASuspected sabotage causes major
OL,4,ANetherlands rail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of the Netherlands, including
OL,7,FAmsterdam, have been hit by major rail
OL,8,Fdisruption after suspected sabotage to
OL,9,Fthe tracks, the country's railway
OL,10,Finfrastructure operator has said.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for operator ProRail
OL,13,Ftold the BBC disruption was not yet
OL,14,Fover but services were gradually
OL,15,Frecovering, after widespread
OL,16,Fcancellations and delays in the
OL,17,Fcountry's centre and north on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
