OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASuspected sabotage causes major
OL,4,ANetherlands rail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FPipes and cables were placed on the
OL,7,Ftracks in multiple locations, according
OL,8,Fto local media. In a statement, ProRail
OL,9,Fsaid the incident appeared to be "an
OL,10,Fintentional disruption... caused by
OL,11,Fhuman action".
OL,13,FIt added that no suspects or motives
OL,14,Fhad been identified. Police said a
OL,15,Fcriminal investigation had been
OL,16,Flaunched.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
